      },
      "created_at": "2026-11-25T17:02:53.000Z",
      "text": "📍 New Delhi\n\nLaunched Toyota Kirloskar Motor’s 1️⃣st Flex Fuel Strong Hybrid Electric Vehicle (FFV-SHEV) in India, the new Innova HyCross, marking a significant milestone in India’s journey towards cleaner, more efficient and sustainable mobility.\n\nCombining Flex Fuel and Self-Charging Strong Hybrid Electric technologies, the vehicle enables approximately 60% of drive time and 40% of the distance to be covered in EV mode, enhancing fuel efficiency.\n\nThis innovative technology offers flexibility in fuel blends, reduces dependence on crude oil and carbon emissions, while supporting farmers’ incomes and strengthening the agro-rural economy.\n\n#FlexFuelStrongHybridElectricVehicle #FFV_SHEV",
      "lang": "en",
      "public_metrics": {
        "reply_count": 11,
        "repost_count": 20,
        "like_count": 148,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "bookmark_count": 4,
        "impression_count": 25779
      },
      "photos": [],
      "video_thumbnail": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2125635409711644672/img/mzNy6xALKwVN2guW.jpg",
      "has_video": true,
      "title_zh": "加德卡里亲自发布印度首款灵活燃料强混车：丰田新Innova HyCross，可烧E20到E85乙醇汽油",
      "summary_zh": "印度道路交通部长尼廷·加德卡里在新德里发布丰田基洛斯卡首款灵活燃料强混动车（FFV-SHEV）新Innova HyCross，称约60%的行驶时间、40%的里程可用纯电模式完成，可适配不同乙醇混合比例，减少原油依赖和碳排放，同时增加农民收入。评论区有人质疑起售价只针对出租车版、普通人买不起，也有人建议政府减免注册费和GST推广。",
