      "created_at": "2026-11-25T12:43:01.000Z",
      "text": "Under the leadership of Hon’ble Prime Minister Shri @narendramodi ji, the Union Cabinet has approved key initiatives to strengthen India's infrastructure, manufacturing and connectivity.\n\n• Approval of the CIE Manufacturing Scheme to boost domestic production of construction and infrastructure equipment.\n\n• Development of a second container terminal at Kamarajar Port to strengthen port capacity and maritime trade.\n\n• Development of a Greenfield Airport at Doloo, Silchar, to enhance regional connectivity in Assam.\n\n• Continuation of the Postal Operations Scheme to improve postal services, logistics and last-mile connectivity.\n\n• Continuation of the Estates Management Scheme to upgrade postal buildings and infrastructure.\n\nThese decisions will strengthen India's infrastructure, improve connectivity and create new opportunities towards a Viksit Bharat.\n\n#CabinetDecisions",
